{
  "rationale": "The plant models robot motion and perception as separate automata. The specification encodes a deterministic exploration policy: random_walk is used in clear/search states, move_forward is used for short progress, and recovery states use directed turns or full_rotate as needed. Safety is enforced by never allowing forward or random_walk in obstacle states, and recovery is conservative but returns to exploration as soon as path_clear is observed.",
  "strategy": [
    "Separate plant automata for motion commands and sensor events to keep the model modular.",
    "Specification automaton encodes a safe, coverage-oriented policy: random_walk in clear, move_forward in short bursts, and recovery via turns or scan only when needed, always returning to exploration when safe."
